ed)'=>'(air a lorg)','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(còdan coitcheann agus co-chomharran a-mhàin)','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'Chaidh glanadh a chuir na stad air %1$s: %2$s. Cha deach dad a sguabadh às.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Cha deach faidhle sa phàirt a phacaigeadh oir cha robh e comasach a leughadh.','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'Chan urrainn do dh\'òstair nach obraich ach aon iarrtas PHP aig an aon àm an ceum seo a choileanadh.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'Lean pàirt dhen luchdadh suas ag fàilligeadh, agus mar sin chaidh an luchdadh suas a chur dheth.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Chan urrainnear eadar-theangachadh iarraidh airson an locale sin air an làrach seo an-dràsta.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version was kept.'=>'Bha sgrìobhadh clàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh ann an còmhstri le iarrtas eile aig %1$s (%2$s) agus cha deach a chur an sàs; chaidh an tionndadh as ùire a chumail.','A translation-index write on %1$s (%2$s) could not be completed and was not applied (%3$s).'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn sgrìobhadh clàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh aig %1$s (%2$s) a choileanadh agus cha deach a chur an sàs (%3$s).','Account'=>'Cunntas','Add another language'=>'Cuir cànan eile ris','Advanced'=>'Adhartach','All'=>'Na h-uile','All free-plan slots for this site are used'=>'Tha slotaichean a’ phlana shaor airson na làraich seo uile gan cleachdadh','All languages'=>'Gach cànan','Already in WordPress core'=>'Cheana ann am bunait WordPress','Already installed.'=>'Stàlaichte mar-thà.','Always share'=>'Always share','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'Tha stàladh eile a\' ruith; feuch a-rithist an ceann tamaill.','Automatic installs'=>'Stàlaidhean fèin-obrachail','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Tha stàlaidhean fèin-obrachail dheth a-nis; cuir air a-rithist iad sna roghainnean ma tha thu gam miannachadh.','Available'=>'Ri fhaighinn','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. While automatic installs are on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Faodar eadar-theangachaidhean a tha rim faighinn a stàladh le aon bhrùthadh, agus faodar na tha a dhìth iarraidh. Fhad ’s a tha stàlaidhean fèin-obrachail air, thèid na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a tha an t-seirbheis a’ liostadh mar rim faighinn airson na cànanan a stiùiricheas tu a stàladh aig an t-sioncronachadh dà thuras gach latha.','Available · %s'=>'Ri fhaighinn · %s','Babilim Settings'=>'Roghainnean Babilim','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Cuiridh Babilim eadar-theangachaidhean ris airson gach cànan a tha air a thaghadh an seo.','Babilim could not confirm a temporary folder outside the website, so the component was not packaged and nothing was uploaded. Define BABILIM_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php as a writable folder outside the web root (for example a folder next to, not inside, your site\'s public directory), or ask your host for one.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dha Babilim pasgan sealach taobh a-muigh an làraich-lìn a dhearbhadh, mar sin cha deach a’ cho-phàirt a phacaigeadh agus cha deach dad a luchdadh suas. Mìnich BABILIM_TEMP_DIR ann an wp-config.php mar phasgan so-sgrìobhte taobh a-muigh freumh an lìn (mar eisimpleir pasgan ri taobh, seach am broinn, pasgan poblach na làraich agad), no iarr fear air an òstair agad.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn do Babilim crìoch a chur air sgrùdadh na làraich seo.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Cha b\' urrainn do Babilim crìoch a chur air a chur an comas (%1$s): %2$s','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn do Babilim crìoch a chur air dearbhadh na làraich seo (cha b\' urrainn dhan t-seirbheis ceangal air ais ris an làrach). Tha an clàradh air a chur air stad.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn do Babilim an làrach seo a dhearbhadh, agus mar sin cha tèid dad a luchdadh a-nuas no a stàladh gus an soirbhich leis an dearbhadh.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn do Babilim an làrach seo a dhearbhadh, mar sin cha deach dad a luchdadh a-nuas no a stàladh.','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Lorgaidh Babilim na plugain agus na h-ùrlaran air an làrach seo aig nach eil eadar-theangachadh don chànan agad agus stàlaichidh e eadar-theangachadh airson gach fear dhiubh.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Chan eil Babilim air a chur an comas airson na làraich seo fhathast.','Babilim has not installed any translation for this language.'=>'Cha do stàlaich Babilim eadar-theangachadh sam bith airson na cànain seo.','Babilim hit an error. Share an error report?'=>'Thachair mearachd ann am Babilim. A bheil thu airson aithisg mhearachd a cho-roinn?','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'Stàlaich Babilim %d eadar-theangachadh gu fèin-obrachail on turas mu dheireadh a thadhail thu.' . "\0" . 'Stàlaich Babilim %d eadar-theangachadh gu fèin-obrachail on turas mu dheireadh a thadhail thu.' . "\0" . 'Stàlaich Babilim %d eadar-theangachaidhean gu fèin-obrachail on turas mu dheireadh a thadhail thu.' . "\0" . 'Stàlaich Babilim %d eadar-theangachadh gu fèin-obrachail on turas mu dheireadh a thadhail thu.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Tha Babilim à comas. Chan eil dad eile ga chur; bidh na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a chaidh a stàladh mu thràth ag obair fhathast.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d phàirt a lorg.' . "\0" . 'Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d phàirt a lorg.' . "\0" . 'Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d pàirtean a lorg.' . "\0" . 'Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d pàirt a lorg.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Tha Babilim ga chur an comas agus a\' sgrùdadh na làraich seo… (oidhirp mu dheireadh: %s)','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Tha Babilim ga chur an comas agus a\' sgrùdadh na làraich seo… Ath-luchdaich an duilleag seo no fuirich gus am bi an sgrùdadh clàraichte deiseil.','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Chan eil Babilim an comas.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Tha Babilim air a shuidheachadh gus dearbh-aithne na làraich seo a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris an làrach seo aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %s. Gus an dearbh-aithne a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Dh’fhalbh an ùine aig Babilim airson a’ cheum seo agus leanaidh e air aig an ath-sgrùdadh.','Babilim settings'=>'Roghainnean Babilim','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'Tha sioncronachadh Babilim air a chuingealachadh rè ùine leis an t-seirbheis (cuingealachadh ìre); feuchaidh e a-rithist às dèidh %s.','Babilim was updated while this upload was waiting. The old package was discarded; please confirm the upload again.'=>'Chaidh Babilim ùrachadh fhad ‘s a bha an luchdadh suas seo a’ feitheamh. Chaidh an seann phacaid a thilgeil air falbh; dearbhaich an luchdadh suas a-rithist.','Babilim will upload these files from %1$s (version %2$s): every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in its main folder. They are used to find the text that needs translating and to identify the plugin or theme.'=>'Luchdaichidh Babilim suas na faidhlichean seo o %1$s (tionndadh %2$s): gach faidhle .php agus .js, gach faidhle block.json, agus readme.txt, readme.md, style.css agus theme.json san prìomh phasgan aige. Thèid an cleachdadh gus an teacsa a lorg a dh’fheumas eadar-theangachadh agus gus am plugan no an ùrlar aithneachadh.','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Chan eil Babilim_Manifest ri fhaighinn: %s','Back'=>'Air ais','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'An do cheannaich thu ceadachas airson an àrainn seo roimhe? Cuir a-steach an còd aiseag a fhuair thu nuair a rinn thu am pàigheadh.','Broken placeholder'=>'Ionad-glèidhidh briste','Build'=>'Build','Built'=>'Air a thogail','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'Bidh mòr-ghnìomhan a\' buntainn ris a\' chànan a chaidh a thaghadh a-mhàin airson gach pàirt a chaidh a thaghadh.','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'Bidh mòr-ghnìomhan a\' buntainn ris a h-uile cànan a fhreagras air na criathragan airson gach pàirt a chaidh a thaghadh.','Bulk download:'=>'Luchdadh a-nuas mòr-chuid:','Bulk request:'=>'Iarrtas mòr-chuid:','Bulk update:'=>'Ùrachadh mòr-chuid:','Bundled with the plugin'=>'An cois a’ phlugain','Bundled with the theme'=>'An cois an ùrlair','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'Le briogadh air Cuir an comas, tha thu ag aontachadh an fhiosrachadh gu h-àrd a chur gu Babilim.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'Ma leanas tu air adhart, dearbhaidh tu gu bheil còir agad am pàirt seo a luchdadh suas.','Cancel'=>'Sguir dheth','Category'=>'Roinn-seòrsa','Check again'=>'Thoir sùil a-rithist','Check again now'=>'Thoir sùil a-rithist an-dràsta','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'Chan eil pròiseas a’ phàighidh ri fhaighinn airson na làraich seo an-dràsta.','Choose'=>'Tagh','Choose a category…'=>'Tagh roinn-seòrsa…','Choose a language'=>'Tagh cànan','Choose a language…'=>'Tagh cànan…','Clear filters'=>'Falamhaich na criathragan','Close'=>'Dùin','Component'=>'Pàirt','Confirm'=>'Dearbh','Conflicting keys'=>'Iuchraichean a tha an còmhstri','Continue'=>'Lean air adhart','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'Lean air adhart leis an ath bhaidse (%d air fhàgail)','Continuing…'=>'A’ leantainn…','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac-glèidhidh de %s a dhèanamh mus deach a chur na àite.','Could not create the package archive.'=>'Cha b’ urrainnear tasglann a’ phacaid a chruthachadh.','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn na pàirtean gnìomhach a dhearbhadh; cha deach an clàr-amais aonaichte a th\' ann a atharrachadh.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn faighinn a-mach dè na plugain/cuspairean a chaidh a stàladh; chaidh an sguabadh a leum thairis agus cha deach dad a sguabadh às.','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn liosta slàn nan ionadan-cànain WordPress.org a luchdadh on t-seirbheis, agus mar sin chan urrainn cànan eile a chur ris an-dràsta.','Could not move %s into place.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %s a ghluasad dhan àite aige.','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn an clàr-amais aonaichte airson \'%s\' a chur na àite; chaidh an clàr-amais roimhe a bha ga sheirbheiseadh (ma bha gin ann) a thoirt air falbh seach a fhàgail letheach ùraichte. Cha tèid leasachadh an raoin bhunaiteach a sheirbheiseadh airson an locale seo gus an ath-thogail shoirbheachail a leanas.','Could not open zip: %s'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn an zip fhosgladh: %s','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %s a ullachadh airson tilleadh air ais.','Could not read %s back after moving it into place.'=>'Cha b’urrainn dhuinn %s a leughadh air ais às dèidh dha a bhith air a ghluasad dhan àite aige.','Could not read: %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainnear a leughadh: %s','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn a’ cheannachd aiseag: %s','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn còd aiseag ùr a shealltainn: %s','Could not stage %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %s a ullachadh','Could not stage default/%s'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn default/%s a ullachadh','Could not start checkout: %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainnear pròiseas a’ phàighidh a thòiseachadh: %s','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn an àireamh de dh’inntrigidhean a dhearbhadh airson %s','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn am pacaid a chaidh a luchdadh a-nuas a sgrìobhadh dhan diosg.','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn an clàr-amais aonaichte air a ullachadh a sgrìobhadh.','Current translation'=>'An t-eadar-theangachadh làithreach','Custom overrides'=>'Ath-sgrìobhaidhean gnàthaichte','Danger zone'=>'Raon cunnartach','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'Chan eil an àireamh de dh’inntrigidhean a’ phàirt-leasachaidh bun-roghainn a’ maidseadh.','Delete all Babilim data on uninstall'=>'Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh','Disable Babilim'=>'Cuir Babilim à comas','Disable Babilim? Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'A bheil thu airson Babilim a chur à comas? Thèid na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a chaidh a stàladh a chumail, ach cha ruith sgrùdaidhean no luchdaidhean a-nuas sam bith tuilleadh.','Don\'t share'=>'Don\'t share','Download'=>'Luchdaich a-nuas','Downloaded and installed.'=>'Chaidh a luchdadh a-nuas agus a stàladh.','Downloading…'=>'A’ luchdadh a-nuas…','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'Luchdaidhean a-nuas: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)','Each component\'s own contribution to each locale\'s shared default-domain supplement.'=>'Cuibhreann fhèin gach pàirt do leasachadh an raoin bhunaiteach co-roinnte aig gach ionad-cànain.','Enable Babilim'=>'Cuir Babilim an comas','Enabling…'=>'Ga chur an comas…','English (United States)'=>'Beurla (na Stàitean Aonaichte)','Entries'=>'Inntrigidhean','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Chan eil an àireamh de dh’inntrigidhean a’ maidseadh airson %s','Error reports'=>'Aithisgean mhearachdan','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'A h-uile plugain/cuspair a chaidh a stàladh: an slug, an tionndadh, raon(an) an teacsa, an e liostadh wp.org a th\' ann, na cànanan aige fhèin a tha ann am pasgan, agus dè na cànanan dhan do stàlaich thu eadar-theangachadh Babilim mu thràth.','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'A h-uile locale a tha ga chleachdadh air an làrach seo (locale na làraich, pacaidean cànain stàlaichte, locales chleachdaichean, agus na chuireas tu ris le làimh). Chan eil locale sam bith air a làimhseachadh ann an dòigh eadar-dhealaichte o gin sam bith eile.','Excluded'=>'Air fhàgail a-mach','Files with other names or extensions are not included, nor are the uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules and languages folders, hidden files, or files whose names match common secrets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'Chan eil faidhlichean le ainmean no leudachain eile air an gabhail a-steach, no na pasgain uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules agus languages, faidhlichean falaichte, no faidhlichean aig a bheil ainmean a fhreagras air dìomhaireachdan cumanta (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Faodaidh teacsa no dàta a bhith ann am faidhlichean còd fhathast nach bu mhath leat a cho-roinn; thoir sùil orra ma tha teagamh agad. Bheir an t-seirbheis air falbh na h-aon seòrsaichean faidhle a-rithist nuair a ruigeas iad.','Free'=>'An-asgaidh','Free-plan slots'=>'Slotaichean a’ phlana shaor','General'=>'Coitcheann','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Ma tha seo air, sguabaidh dì-stàladh às dearbh-aithne na làraich seo cuideachd. Chan urrainn dhuinn an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris an làrach seo aiseag gu fèin-obrachail às dèidh sin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %s gus a faighinn air ais.','Included'=>'Air a ghabhail a-steach','Included in index'=>'Air a ghabhail a-steach san chlàr-amais','Install available translations automatically'=>'Stàlaich eadar-theangachaidhean ri fhaighinn gu fèin-obrachail','Installed'=>'Air a stàladh','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Thèid na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a chaidh a stàladh a chumail, ach cha ruith sgrùdaidhean no luchdaidhean a-nuas sam bith tuilleadh.','Installed · %s'=>'Air a stàladh · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson %1$s, tha %2$s aig an làrach seo','Installed · built for %s'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson %s','Installed · built for %s, all free-plan slots for this site are used'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson %s, tha slotaichean a’ phlana shaor airson na làraich seo uile gan cleachdadh','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Air a stàladh · air a thogail airson %s, dh\'fhàillig an tionndadh ùr','Installed · built for %s, new version not covered by the free service plan'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson %s, chan eil an tionndadh ùr air a chòmhdach le plana seirbheis an-asgaidh','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson %s, tionndadh ùr clàraichte','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson %s, ag eadar-theangachadh an tionndaidh ùir…','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson tionndadh eile','Installed · built for a different version, all free-plan slots for this site are used'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson tionndadh eile, tha slotaichean a’ phlana shaor airson na làraich seo uile gan cleachdadh','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Air a stàladh · air a thogail airson tionndadh eile, dh\'fhàillig an tionndadh ùr','Installed · built for a different version, new version not covered by the free service plan'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson tionndadh eile, chan eil an tionndadh ùr air a chòmhdach le plana seirbheis an-asgaidh','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson tionndadh eile, tionndadh ùr clàraichte','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Stàlaichte · air a thogail airson tionndadh eile, ag eadar-theangachadh an tionndaidh ùir…','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'Thèid a stòradh le solaraiche aoigheachd na seirbheis agus a phròiseasadh le modailean AI gus an eadar-theangachadh a dhèanamh.','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Cùm na h-ath-sgrìobhaidhean eadar-theangachaidh agam fhìn nuair a thèid a h-uile càil a ghlanadh no am plugan seo a dhì-stàladh.','Language'=>'Cànan','Language:'=>'Cànan:','Languages'=>'Cànanan','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Cànanan a chaidh a lorg air an làrach seo: %s.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'An glanadh mu dheireadh air %1$s: %2$d air a chomharrachadh às ùr, %3$d faidhle air an sguabadh às, %4$d clàr air a thoirt air falbh.','Maintenance'=>'Cumail-suas','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'Chan eil staid a’ chumail suas ri fhaighinn an-dràsta.','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Chan eil manifest ri fhaighinn: %s','Negation reversed'=>'Chaidh an àicheadh a thionndadh bun-os-cionn','No'=>'Chan eil','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Chan eil togail ri fhaighinn airson a luchdadh a-nuas airson an sgeama ionadail seo.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Cha deach glanadh a ruith fhathast.','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Chan eil co-phàirt sam bith a’ freagairt ris na criathragan seo. %s','No components synced yet.'=>'Cha deach co-phàirt sam bith a shioncronachadh fhathast.','No installed translation matches.'=>'Chan eil eadar-theangachadh stàlaichte sam bith a\' maidseadh.','No language is managed yet.'=>'Chan eil cànan sam bith fo stiùireadh fhathast.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Chan eil dùbhlan sam bith ri feitheamh airson an nonce seo.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Chan eil dùbhlan ri dhearbhadh an-dràsta.','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Cha deach plugain no ùrlaran a lorg.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Chan eil togail roimhe ann airson tilleadh air ais thuice.','No record for %s'=>'Chan eil clàr ann airson %s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Chan eil ID làraich clàraichte gus tòcan na làraich ùrachadh.','No — component inactive'=>'Chan eil — pàirt neo-ghnìomhach','No — component removed'=>'Chan eil — pàirt air a thoirt air falbh','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Chan eil — tha an tionndadh a chaidh a stàladh eadar-dhealaichte on tè ghnìomhach','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Chan e server_build_id dligheach a th\' ann: %s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'Chan eil e air a chòmhdach le plana seirbheis an-asgaidh','Not installed'=>'Gun stàladh','Not registered yet'=>'Gun chlàradh fhathast','Not supported'=>'Gun taic','Not verified'=>'Gun dearbhadh','Note (optional)'=>'Nòta (roghainneil)','Nothing to choose.'=>'Chan eil dad ri thaghadh.','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Chan eil dad ri dhearbhadh.','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Dheth a ghnàth: ma sguabas tu às am plugan, thèid dearbh-aithne na làraich seo a chumail, gus an gabh a h-ath-chleachdadh ma stàlaicheas tu am plugan a-rithist.','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Chan eil faidhle no dhà no barrachd a chaidh a lìbhrigeadh a’ freagairt ris an manifest tuilleadh.','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Ceannachd aon-turas airson na làraich seo: %1$s %2$s. Gabhaidh e a-steach a h-uile ùrachadh eadar-theangachaidh san àm ri teachd. Bidh Paddle a’ làimhseachadh a’ phàighidh ann an taba ùr.','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Chan urrainn ach do rianaire lìonraidh seo a dhèanamh, oir atharraichidh e faidhlichean eadar-theangachaidh a tha air an co-roinneadh leis a h-uile làrach air an lìonra seo.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Chan urrainnear ach plugain agus cuspairean a phacaigeadh.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Dìreach nuair a dhearbhaicheas tu luchdadh suas airson plugan no ùrlar nach eil air WordPress.org: gach faidhle .php agus .js, gach faidhle block.json, agus readme.txt, readme.md, style.css agus theme.json ann am prìomh phasgan a’ cho-phàirt sin, mar zip, às dèidh faidhlichean a fhreagras air dìomhaireachdan cumanta fhàgail a-mach.','Open Babilim settings'=>'Fosgail Roghainnean Babilim','Original language'=>'Cànan tùsail','Original string'=>'An sreang thùsail','Paid'=>'Pàighte','Partner'=>'Com-pàirtiche','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Dèan cinnteach gun gabh an làrach agad ruigsinn on eadar-lìon, agus feuch ris a-rithist.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Tagh roinn-seòrsa airson na h-aithisge seo.','Plugin'=>'Plugan','Plugin · %s'=>'Plugan · %s','Plugins'=>'Plugain','Preview'=>'Ro-shealladh','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Chaidh a’ cheannachd aiseag. Tha cead aig an làrach seo a-nis.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Cha robh an àireamh de chlàran a chaidh ath-pharsadh co-ionnan ris a\' chlàr-amais a chaidh a thogail.','Re-verify'=>'Dearbh a-rithist','Rebuild index now'=>'Ath-thog an clàr-amais a-nis','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'A\' diùltadh sgrìobhadh taobh a-muigh pasgan faidhlichean cànain Babilim.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'Bha raointean riatanach a dhìth air freagairt a’ chlàraidh.','Registration restarted.'=>'Chaidh an clàradh ath-thòiseachadh.','Remove'=>'Thoir air falbh','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Thoir air falbh a h-uile dad a stàlaich Babilim','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'A bheil thu airson a h-uile dad a stàlaich Babilim a thoirt air falbh? Sguabaidh seo às a h-uile faidhle cànain a stàlaich e airson gach plugan agus ùrlar air an làrach seo.','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'A bheil thu airson an t-eadar-theangachadh %2$s de %1$s a thoirt air falbh on làrach seo?','Removed %d installed component.'=>'Chaidh %d phàirt stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh.' . "\0" . 'Chaidh %d phàirt stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh.' . "\0" . 'Chaidh %d pàirtean stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh.' . "\0" . 'Chaidh %d pàirt stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh.','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Chaidh a thoirt air falbh às dèidh sgrùdadh slàine a dh’fhàillig','Removed.'=>'Chaidh a thoirt air falbh.','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Bheir seo air falbh a h-uile faidhle cànain a stàlaich Babilim airson gach plugan agus ùrlar air an làrach seo.','Report a problem'=>'Dèan aithris air duilgheadas','Report translation'=>'Dèan aithris air an eadar-theangachadh','Request newer translation'=>'Iarr eadar-theangachadh nas ùire','Request translation'=>'Iarr eadar-theangachadh','Requestable'=>'Ri iarraidh','Requesting…'=>'Ag iarraidh…','Restart registration'=>'Ath-thòisich an clàradh','Restore code'=>'Còd aiseag','Restore purchase'=>'Aisig ceannach','Retry request'=>'Feuch an iarrtas a-rithist','Roll back'=>'Till air ais','Roll back and report'=>'Till air ais agus dèan aithris','Roll back and send report'=>'Till air ais agus cuir aithris','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'A bheil thu airson eadar-theangachadh %2$s de %1$s a thilleadh dhan build roimhe?','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Chaidh a thilleadh agus aithris.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Chaidh a thilleadh dhan build roimhe.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Chaidh a thilleadh, ach cha b\' urrainnear an aithisg a chur: %s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Bhiodh tilleadh air ais a’ sgrìobhadh thairis air \'%1$s\' (%2$s), a tha a-nis air a sheirbheiseadh airson pàirt stàlaichte eile (%3$s); cha deach dad atharrachadh.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'Bha site_token a dhìth air freagairt an iarrtais gus an tòcan ùrachadh.','Save changes'=>'Sàbhail na h-atharraichean','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Clàraichte, a’ feitheamh ri pròiseasadh','Search'=>'Lorg','Search components'=>'Lorg co-phàirtean','Search the installed translations'=>'Lorg anns na h-eadar-theangachaidhean stàlaichte','Select all'=>'Tagh na h-uile','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Tagh nas lugha de cho-phàirtean: %1$d gnìomhachd air a\' char as motha gach ruith (thagh thu %2$d).','Send report'=>'Cuir aithisg','Service plan'=>'Plana na seirbheis','Settings'=>'Roghainnean','Share error reports'=>'Co-roinn aithisgean mhearachdan','Share this report'=>'Co-roinn an aithisg seo','Show a new restore code'=>'Seall còd aiseag ùr','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'Seall an inntrigeadh “Aithris air eadar-theangachadh” ann am bàr-inneal na rianachd','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Tha cuid de theacsa a’ phàirt seo air a chòdachadh gu cruaidh leis an ùghdar agus chan urrainn do phacaid cànain eadar-theangachadh.','Status'=>'Staid','Status unknown'=>'Staid neo-aithnichte','String context'=>'Co-theacsa an t-sreang','Suggested translation'=>'Eadar-theangachadh molta','Supplementary translation index'=>'Clàr-amais nan eadar-theangachaidhean leasachail','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Chaidh clàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh leasachail ath-thogail.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Cumail suas an eadar-theangachaidh a bharrachd','Supplementary translations'=>'Eadar-theangachaidhean leasachail','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Chaidh an sguabadh a chuir dheth gun dìlleachdan a dhèanamh de dad: %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d fhaidhle a sguabadh às.' . "\0" . 'Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d fhaidhle a sguabadh às.' . "\0" . 'Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d faidhlichean a sguabadh às.' . "\0" . 'Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d faidhle a sguabadh às.','Sweep now'=>'Sguab an-dràsta','Sync complete.'=>'Tha an sioncronachadh deiseil.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Tapadh leibh. Chaidh an aithisg agad a chur.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Chan eil am pàirt sin air a stàladh air an làrach seo, agus mar sin chan urrainn eadar-theangachadh iarraidh air a shon.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Chan eil sin coltach ri còd aiseag.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Chan e còd ionadail WordPress dligheach a tha sin. Cha deach dad a shàbhaladh.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Chan e aithnichear build dligheach a tha sin.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn an t-atharrachadh a chlàradh sa chlàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh; feuch a-rithist e.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Ruith an glanadh, ach cha b\' urrainn dhuinn cuid de na h-atharrachaidhean aige a chlàradh sa chlàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh; feuchaidh an ath ghlanadh ris an clàradh a-rithist.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'Chan eil faidhle sam bith aig a’ cho-phàirt a ghabhas luchdadh suas.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Chan eil am pàirt am broinn an eòlaire phlugain no ùrlaran.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Cha deach prìomh fhaidhle a’ phàirt a lorg.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Cha robh ionad so-chleachdte ann am freagairt an luchdaidh a-nuas.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'Fosglaidh an inntrigeadh seo panail airson lorg anns na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a stàlaich Babilim air an làrach seo agus aithris a dhèanamh air fear dhiubh.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'Tha an raon "%1$s" ro fhada: tha %2$d caractar ann agus is e %3$d a\' chrìoch. Cha deach dad a chur; giorraich e agus feuch ris a-rithist.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Chan eil an raon a chaidh a thoirt \'%1$s\' a\' maidseadh slug manifest a\' phacaid fhèin \'%2$s\' no an text_domain aige \'%3$s\'.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'Chaidh an clàr-amais aonaichte airson \'%s\' ath-thogail, ach cha b\' urrainn don chlàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh a chlàradh; feuchaidh an ath-thogail a leanas a-rithist.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Thèid an teacsa tùsail agus na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a rinneadh uaith a thoirt do làraichean eile a stàlaicheas an aon tionndadh.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Chan eil a’ phacaid a’ cur an cèill prìomh fhaidhle eadar-theangachaidh.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Chan eil %s anns a\' phacaid airson raon an teacsa aice fhèin.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Chan eil seòrsa manifest a\' phacaid \'%1$s\' a\' maidseadh an t-seòrsa a chaidh iarraidh \'%2$s\'.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Cha tug a’ phacaid prìomh fhaidhle eadar-theangachaidh a ghabhas a sheirbheiseadh gu buil.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Chan eil raon an teacsa aig a\' phacaid \'%1$s\' a\' maidseadh lethbhreac na làraich seo dhen phàirt (\'%2$s\'), agus mar sin cha deach a stàladh.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn am pàirt pacaichte a leughadh.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Chan eil an dùbhlan clàraidh san riochd ris a bheil dùil.','The report could not be sent.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn an aithisg a chur.','The search could not be completed.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn dhuinn an lorg a choileanadh.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Dh’iarr an t-seirbheis air an làrach seo feitheamh mus sioncronaich i a-rithist.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Cha b\' urrainn don t-seirbheis ruigsinn air an làrach agad. Tha e coltach gu bheil balla-teine, plugan tèarainteachd no riaghailt aig an òstair a\' bacadh na h-iarrtais; ceadaich iarrtasan gu /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Cha robh tairgse luchdaidh suas na seirbheise coileanta.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'Tha an raon-teacsa \'%1$s\' (%2$s) \'ga sheirbheiseadh mu thràth airson pàirt stàlaichte eile (%3$s); cha deach dad a stàlaichadh.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Thèid an luchdadh suas a chumail gus an iarr thu air Babilim a sguabadh às.','Theme'=>'Ùrlar','Theme · %s'=>'Ùrlar · %s','Themes'=>'Ùrlaran','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Chan eil luchdadh suas a’ dol.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Chan eil luchdadh suas a’ feitheamh airson dearbhadh.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Seo na cànanan a chleachdas an làrach seo. Faodaidh tu an atharrachadh ann an %s.','These fields will be sent:'=>'Thèid na raointean seo a chur:','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Chan e build a tha an làrach seo a’ aithneachadh an-dràsta airson a’ phàirt/ionadail seo a th’ ann.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Chan eil am pàirt seo a’ cur an cèill àireamh tionndaidh, agus mar sin chan urrainn eadar-theangachadh iarraidh air a shon.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Tha am pàirt seo nas motha na na gabhas an t-seirbheis ris, agus mar sin chan urrainn dhuinn a luchdadh suas.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Chaidh am pàirt seo a luchdadh suas mar-thà. Tha Babilim ga sgrùdadh an-dràsta.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Tha àireamh tionndaidh a’ phàirt seo nas fhaide na %d caractar, rud nach urrainn do Babilim làimhseachadh, agus mar sin chan urrainn eadar-theangachadh iarraidh air a shon.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Bheir seo a-mach còd aiseag ùr agus stadaidh an seann fhear ag obair. A bheil thu airson leantainn air adhart?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Tha cus làraichean air an lìonra seo airson an sgrùdadh fa leth, agus dh’fhaodadh gu bheil cuid dhiubh air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ri làrach den leithid aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Tionndadh a\' phlugain seo fhèin, gus an urrainn don t-seirbheis innse dhut a ùrachadh ma tha e ro shean airson conaltradh ris.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Chan eil an aithisg seo ag ainmeachadh plugan no cuspair agus locale dligheach.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Chan eil an aithisg seo ag ainmeachadh sreang stàlaichte.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Chan eil build dligheach aig an aithisg seo airson aithris a dhèanamh air.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Thèid an aithisg seo a phostadh gu poblach air GitHub agus dh\'fhaodadh treas pàrtaidhean a cumail.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Cha deach an còd aiseag seo aithneachadh airson na làraich seo.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Tha clàradh gnìomhach aig an làrach seo mu thràth nach gabh aiseag gu fèin-obrachail tuilleadh.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Tha %1$d pàirt aig an làrach seo thar %2$d cànan, agus tha feum air %3$d baidse sgrùdaidh; chan urrainn do Babilim barrachd air %4$d a làimhseachadh anns gach ruith. Lùghdaich na cànanan a thathar a’ riaghladh ann an Roghainnean no cuir à comas na plugain agus na h-ùrlaran nach eil gan cleachdadh, agus an uair sin briog air Thoir sùil a-rithist an-dràsta.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Chan eil ceannachd aig an làrach seo airson còd a shealltainn.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Tha an làrach seo fo cheadachas mu thràth. Ath-luchdaich an duilleag.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Chan eil an làrach seo clàraichte le Babilim fhathast.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Tha an làrach seo nas motha na na ghabhas an t-seirbheis ann an aon sioncronachadh, agus mar sin chaidh cuid de nithean fhàgail a-mach: %1$d co-phàirtean agus %2$d locales.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Tha an làrach seo na pàirt de lìonra ioma-làraich, nach stàlaich eadar-theangachaidhean ùra gu fèin-obrachail. Thèid eadar-theangachaidhean a tha air an stàladh mu thràth ùrachadh fhathast.','This site is verified.'=>'Tha an làrach seo dearbhte.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Feumaidh an làrach seo a bhith dearbhte an toiseach.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'URL na làraich seo, gus an urrainn don t-seirbheis dearbhadh gur leatsa i.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Tha seòladh na làraich seo ro fhada airson Babilim a chlàradh.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Locale rèiteichte na làraich seo.','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'Iuchair phoblach stàlaichte na làraich seo, a thathas a\' cleachdadh gus dearbhadh gu bheil iarrtasan a\' tighinn bhon làrach seo da-rìribh. Cha tèid ach an leth poblach a chur a-chaoidh.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Chan urrainn do Babilim còd ionadail na làraich seo a chlàradh.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Chan urrainn dhut aithris a dhèanamh air an t-sreang seo on làrach seo.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Chan eil an sreang seo am measg nan eadar-theangachaidhean a tha stàlaichte air an làrach seo. Lorg a-rithist agus tagh i on liosta.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Chaidh an t-eadar-theangachadh seo ùrachadh on a rinn thu lorg. Lorg a-rithist agus tagh an sreang on liosta ùr.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Airson am pàirt seo eadar-theangachadh, tha feum aig Babilim air an tùs aige.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Cus oidhirpean. Feuch ris a-rithist a-màireach.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Cus aithisgean an-diugh. Feuch ris a-rithist a-màireach.','Too many requests.'=>'Cus iarrtasan.','Toolbar'=>'Bàr-inneal','Translating…'=>'Ag eadar-theangachadh…','Translation does not load'=>'Chan eil an eadar-theangachadh a’ luchdadh','Translation failed'=>'Dh’fhàillig an t-eadar-theangachadh','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Gabhaidh faidhlichean eadar-theangachaidh a chuireas tu ann an %s prìomhachas an-còmhnaidh thairis air feadhainn Babilim. Bidh iad air an cumail mura toir thu a\' chromag às a\' bhogsa seo.','Translation requested.'=>'Chaidh eadar-theangachadh iarraidh.','Translations'=>'Eadar-theangachaidhean','Type'=>'Seòrsa','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Sgrìobh co-dhiù 2 charactar gus lorg.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Freagairt HTTP %d ris nach robh dùil.','Uninstall'=>'Dì-stàlaich','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Seòrsa neo-aithnichte: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Raon neo-thèarainte: %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Locale neo-shàbhailte: %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Slug neo-shàbhailte: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'text_domain neo-shàbhailte: %s','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Suas gu 20 tachartas breithneachaidh a tha ri feitheamh (m.e. faidhle nach do chaidh leis an sgrùdadh slàine), gach fear dhiubh dìreach còd, pàirt agus cànan, agus gun susbaint sreang no teacsa eadar-theangaichte idir.','Update'=>'Ùraich','Update available'=>'Ùrachadh ri fhaighinn','Updates'=>'Ùrachaidhean','Updating…'=>'Ag ùrachadh…','Upgrade this site'=>'Uasghrèadaich an làrach seo','Upload and request'=>'Luchdaich suas is iarr','Upload cancelled.'=>'Chaidh an luchdadh suas a chur dheth.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Luchdadh suas deiseil — chaidh eadar-theangachadh iarraidh.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Dh’fhalbh an ùine air an luchdadh suas mus do chrìochnaich e','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Luchdadh suas a’ dol – lean air adhart no sguir dheth','Upload this component?'=>'An luchdaich thu suas am pàirt seo?','Upload was not accepted'=>'Cha deach an luchdadh suas a ghabhail ris','Uploading'=>'Ag luchdadh suas','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Ag luchdadh suas pàirt %1$d à %2$d…','Uploading…'=>'Ag luchdadh suas…','Verified'=>'Dearbhte','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Bha site_token a dhìth air freagairt an dearbhaidh.','Version %s'=>'Tionndadh %s','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Na thèid a chur nuair a sgrùdas Babilim an làrach seo','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Dè a thèid a chur nuair a chuireas tu Babilim an comas','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Nuair a dh\'fhailicheas rudeigin am broinn Babilim, cuir aithisg mhearachd gu Seirbheis Babilim airson a foillseachadh mar cheist phoblach air GitHub. Thèid an aithisg a chur às leth na làraich seo, leis an dearbhadh co-ionnan ris a h-uile iarrtas eile gu Seirbheis Babilim. Chan fhoillsich an t-seirbheis ach còd na mearachd agus na tionndaidhean mar cheist phoblach air GitHub; chan eil seòladh làraich, susbaint no slighean fhaidhlichean sa cheist phoblach. Dheth a ghnàth.','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Càite am faca tu seo (roghainneil)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Fhad ’s a tha seo air, thèid na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a tha an t-seirbheis a’ liostadh mar rim faighinn airson na cànanan a stiùiricheas tu a stàladh aig an t-sioncronachadh dà thuras gach latha.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Ceàrr airson a’ cho-theacsa seo','Wrong meaning'=>'Brìgh cheàrr','Wrong plural form'=>'Cruth iolra ceàrr','Wrong term'=>'Briathar ceàrr','Yes'=>'Tha','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Chan eil cead agad seo a dhèanamh.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Tionndadh PHP agad, airson co-chòrdalachd.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Tionndadh WordPress agad, gus faidhlichean eadar-theangachaidh co-chòrdail a thoirt seachad.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'An còd aiseag ùr agad: %s. Cùm an àiteigin sàbhailte e – chan obraich an seann chòd tuilleadh.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Thèid d\' aithisg a phròiseasadh gu fèin-obrachail le modailean AI agus dh\'fhaodadh i an t-eadar-theangachadh seo a leasachadh airson làraichean eile.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Fhreagair an làrach agad, ach chan ann leis na bha dùil. Dh\'fhaodadh gu bheil plugan eile ag ath-sgrìobhadh an REST API, no gu bheil an endpoint sin air a thasgadh; fàg /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge a-mach à tasgadh agus ath-sgrìobhadh.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Thug an làrach agad ro fhada gus freagairt. Feuch ris a-rithist an ceann greis, agus dèan cinnteach nach eil an t-òstair ro slaodach no ro thrang.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Chan eil manifest.json anns an zip.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Tha am faidhle bun-roghainn ris an robh dùil a dhìth sa zip: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Tha faidhle ris an robh dùil a dhìth sa zip: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'Tha structar air _manifest.json nach robh dùil ris','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'cha b’ urrainn dhuinn _manifest.json a leughadh: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'Tha expected_manifest a dhìth no tha \'%s\' mì-dhligheach ann.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'Chan e id togail dhligheach a th’ ann an “server_build_id” aig expected_manifest.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'Cha b’ urrainnear _manifest.json a pharsadh: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'dhèanadh e dìlleachdan de %1$d à %2$d de phàirtean fo stiùir (barrachd air leth)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'dhèanadh e dìlleachdan de gach pàirt fo stiùir de sheòrsa %1$s (%2$d à %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Chan eil an àireamh de dh’inntrigidhean l10n.php a’ maidseadh airson %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'Tha \'default_domain_entries\' mì-dhligheach ann am manifest.json.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'Tha \'default_domain_files\' mì-dhligheach ann am manifest.json.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'Chan eil manifest.json san zip na JSON dligheach.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'Tha manifest.json a dhìth no tha \'%s\' mì-dhligheach ann.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'Tha manifest.json a dhìth no tha \'build_no\' mì-dhligheach ann.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'Tha manifest.json a dhìth no tha \'entries\' mì-dhligheach ann.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'Tha manifest.json a dhìth no tha \'extra_domains\' mì-dhligheach ann.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'Tha manifest.json a dhìth no tha \'files\' mì-dhligheach ann.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'Chan eil \'%s\' aig manifest.json a\' maidseadh an luach a bha dùil.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'Chan e sreang tionndaidh dhligheach a th’ ann an “contract” aig manifest.json.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'Feumaidh \'kind\' ann am manifest.json a bhith \'plugin\' no \'theme\'.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'Chan e id togail dhligheach a th’ ann an \'server_build_id\' aig manifest.json.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'Feumaidh “status” ann am manifest.json a bhith “published”.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'Feumaidh an nonce a bhith na shreang heicseadheicimeach.','per day'=>'gach latha','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'mì-fhreagarrachd sha256 airson %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'mì-fhreagarrachd sha256 airson default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'plugan','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'cuspair','problem report categoryOther'=>'Eile','translation statusAvailable'=>'Ri fhaighinn','translation statusInstalled'=>'Stàlaichte']];